  "note": "A2 lisc, rides a2_plural_nom / a2_past_plural / a2_past_byc / a2_past_ac / a2_past_rest. A1 (a1_home_family) already owns rodzina, mama, matka, tata, ojciec, brat, siostra, syn, corka, dziecko, kobieta, mezczyzna, kolega, kolezanka, przyjaciel, przyjaciolka - all ANCHORS here, never re-taught. This pack teaches 12 new family nouns, every one with a gender badge. rodzice and dzieci are plural-only / irregular and are taught WHOLE - they are fenced out of a2_plural_nom on purpose, so this is where they land. Three sentences depend on byli / byly / mieszkali from a2_past_plural, which sits immediately before this node in path_order.",
